    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Two young women create an online forum just for themselves, like a small, remote digital island. It’s a refuge from the world and its violence, a protective shield for both of them. This peaceful feminine oasis quickly attracts attention and arouses all kinds of envy. Several people decide they want a piece of the island, going so far as to attempt to invade the digital space over which its creators are gradually losing control. \n\nFeaturing a large cast from across the..."
      }
